    "rationale": "Mechanisms check both admission flags and exact empty clip bindings, selective font/scalar needs and duplicate IDs. One parser lifecycle case overlaps clip sources with dormant group ownership; one prepared case opens only the selected font. Seven role-specific images each use one canonical call; no fixture/API product."
  },
